66861", "author": {"steamid": "76561198004416842", "personaname": "Vaughan Vic", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Tough_Wanamingo/", "num_games_owned": 509, "num_reviews": 24, "playtime_forever": 3325, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2556, "last_played": 1642049181, "avatar": "61cb19b58061cf98dff438215ee299346a791ab0"}, "language": "english", "review": "A fairly underrated shooter that's gotten a bad rap. Sure the story is kinda lacking, but it has SPESS MAHREENZ. Sure it's an old game that has an almost completely dead online community, but it has SPESS MAHREENZ. Sure what little of the online community is left is plagued with tryhards and pricks using the overpowered Vengeance Launcher, but it has SPESS MAHREENZ.  Sure the game came out around the same time as Gears of Wat Tree, which also has it's own [i]\"space marines\"[/i], but those guys suck and the game was only released for the cardboard box. \n\n[strike]Also Sega is bound to add their logo to it eventually. I'm sure that's exactly what's needed to breath some life into this forgotten and mediocre title.[/strike]\n\nTHEY ADDED THE LOGO! NOW IT'S PERFECT GAME!", "timestamp_created": 1404112245, "timestamp_updated": 1427343036, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "10965213", "author": {"steamid": "76561197973680578", "personaname": "000Frosty000", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197973680578/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 891, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 815, "last_played": 1632485161, "avatar": "15208bbc33cad16a2a4866aced8541dcf2fe49b8"}, "language": "english", "revie